  ("Can Instagram support restore an account after 30 days?","No. After the deletion is final, Instagram can’t restore it."),
  ("What’s the difference between deactivated and deleted?","Deactivating hides your account until you log in. Deleting removes it for good after 30 days."),
  ("Can I get my old username back?","If no one else takes it after the deletion, you can try to claim it on a new account."),
  ("Can Unbanz recover a deleted account?","Not after the 30 days. Inside the window, or if a hacker deleted it, we can help through the official route."),
